body:
Hey @Asahro,

You can use [`padding: 2`](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/pagination.html#struct-PaginationWidgetOptions-padding) in the widget options of pagination.

```js
search.addWidget(
  instantsearch.widgets.pagination({ 
    padding: 2, 
  })
);
```
